{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bcrypt-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To use bcrypt in react js, you have to install  and than import  from  and then you have use  function from bcrypt that how…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To use bcrypt in react js, you have to install <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcryptjs\"</code> and than import <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcrypt\"</code> from <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcryptjs\"</code> and then you have use <code class=\"language-text\">hash</code> function from bcrypt that how you can use bcryptjs in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to use bcrypt in react js.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>Install the following packages to use bcryptjs in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">npm</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npm install bcryptjs\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">yarn</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">yarn add bcryptjs</code></pre></div>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> bcrypt <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"bcryptjs\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">{String.fromCharCode(169)}</code> to use bcrypt in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>input\n  type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"password\"</span>\n  value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>password<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  onChange<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setPassword</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>target<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  placeholder<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Enter password\"</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>handleHashPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hash Password<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hashedPassword <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hashed Password<span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>textarea readOnly value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hashedPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> rows<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"3\"</span> cols<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"50\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Use bcrypt example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. you have to install <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcryptjs\"</code> and than import <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcrypt\"</code> from <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcryptjs\"</code> to use bcrypt in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"react\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> bcrypt <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"bcryptjs\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>password<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>hashedPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setHashedPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">handleHashPassword</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> saltRounds <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Number of salt rounds</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> hash <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> bcrypt<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">hash</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>password<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> saltRounds<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">setHashedPassword</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>hash<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h3<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hash a Password<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h3<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>input\n        type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"password\"</span>\n        value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>password<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        onChange<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setPassword</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>target<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        placeholder<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Enter password\"</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>handleHashPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hash Password<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hashedPassword <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n          <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hashed Password<span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n          <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>textarea readOnly value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>hashedPassword<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> rows<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"3\"</span> cols<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"50\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">\"bcryptjs\"</code> to use bcrypt in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 539px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f4acc46bc5beb6a44eed2bdcaa0aa5c4/9cb26/use-bcrypt.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 79.11392405063292%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmAAAABXRUJQVlA4IFQAAADQAwCdASoUABAAPtFWpEuoJKOhsAgBABoJYwCdEf/gPI7wBmi1kQAA/eO+4WvKeRN7wVe2VGWRsK5H/q2mITmkwnzRBNtu74oEb8UBhYTpbUywAAA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, use, bcrypt\"\n        title=\"React, use, bcrypt\"\n        src=\"/static/f4acc46bc5beb6a44eed2bdcaa0aa5c4/9cb26/use-bcrypt.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/f4acc46bc5beb6a44eed2bdcaa0aa5c4/81b7c/use-bcrypt.webp 158w,\n/static/f4acc46bc5beb6a44eed2bdcaa0aa5c4/6ea66/use-bcrypt.webp 315w,\n/static/f4acc46bc5beb6a44eed2bdcaa0aa5c4/9cb26/use-bcrypt.webp 539w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 539px) 100vw, 539px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to use bcrypt in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"December 10, 2024","description":"Example of use bcrypt in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use bootstrap tooltip in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bootstrap-tooltip-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use anchor tag in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-09-how-to-use-anchor-tag-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bcrypt-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bootstrap-tooltip-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-12-09-how-to-use-anchor-tag-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}